    "spec": "The business-day rule for the registration date must extend to public holidays: when the adjusted date lands on a listed public holiday, roll forward to the next non-holiday business day. The fixed public-holiday list is 2026-01-01, 2026-01-26, 2026-04-25, 2026-12-25, 2026-12-28.",
    "prompt": "Implement the following change to the application so that it fully satisfies\nthe specification and all existing and new tests pass. Run the test suite and\nmake it green before finishing.\n\nThe business-day rule for the registration date must extend to public holidays: when the adjusted date lands on a listed public holiday, roll forward to the next non-holiday business day. The fixed public-holiday list is 2026-01-01, 2026-01-26, 2026-04-25, 2026-12-25, 2026-12-28.\n"
  },
